  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">From Dialogue to Partnership: Sustaining Interfaith Peace in Somaliland Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The intervention aims to strengthen Freedom of Religion or Belief (FoRB) in Somaliland by empowering Christian minorities, sensitizing officials, and fostering interfaith dialogue. Participants include religious minority believers, government officials, religious leaders, clan elders, CSOs, and media actors. Main activities are legal literacy and resilience workshops, policy dialogues, cross-border believer networking, and multi-stakeholder forums. Expected outcomes are improved FoRB awareness among officials, empowered believers, and broader community support for peaceful coexistence and tolerance.</narrative>
  </description>
